{"sections":[{"slug":"整体截面","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"整体截面"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">整体截面</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“整体截面”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">层</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的整体截面是整个空间上的截面</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">等于到一个点</span> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/终对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">终对象</span>"}},{"Plain":") <span lang=\"zh\">的态射的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/直像","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">直像</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">整体截面是</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">左正合</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">函子</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其右</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/导出函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">导出函子</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">给出</span> (Abel <span lang=\"zh\">层的</span>) "},{"Local":{"url":"/层上同调","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">层上同调</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}